    </p>
    
    <div class="flex gap-[4vw] md:gap-[1.5vw] mt-[6vw] md:mt-[2.5vw]">
      <button class="px-[5vw] py-[2.5vw] md:px-[2vw] md:py-[0.8vw] bg-white text-black rounded-full text-[3.5vw] md:text-[1vw] font-bold shadow-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-transform hover:scale-105">
